Z||000000||1FST2M6||02-05-2001||08:47 AM||||well I went and picked up Donald saturday morning and took hiim down to the shop where he was able to pick up his TURBO 85 GT... he said it was running like a top. it's got .020 shaved heads, and a rebuild CT26 with super 60 wheels. all from the original manufacture. the rebuilders said it should support up to 300hp with the new wheels and gave him a 1 year unlimited mileage warranty.  After a couple weeks of him driving it (250-300ish miles) we'll dyno/tune the car and let everyone know how brutal she really is.. its sure does sound MEAN! an additional bung was welded in for the wide band O2 sensor for the Competition Data Systems data logging system to monitor the car for dialing in the BEST HP and TQ numbers we can. <P>Ed said "..it's a Sweet kit. the turbo seemed pretty small for the motor but working with cost-effectiveness and size constraints it's a perfect setup for a street car."<P>Nice ride Donald!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig1fst.jpg"> ||||reg||1
