Z||000004||1FST2M6||02-05-2001||10:57 AM||||heh.. no.. <A HREF="http://www.designonesystems.com" TARGET=_blank>www.designonesystems.com</A>   it's a turbo kit that both I and Ed (owner of Engineered Performance) had a hard time justifying due to the size of the turbo on a 2.8+ it flows barly enough to support the motor at 5000rpm. however with super 60 wheels it'll flow it all day long and it's not really pricey. $4000 retail for the kit. Donald got his off e-bay and it had bad seals and the car since it only has 20k miles on the original motor he wiped out a head gasket. with the new gaskets, seals and turbine wheels he'll soon be the MAN to beat around here.. now if i could just get him to let me test it out on a friday night..   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I'll split the winnings!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   i don't sell the kits.. but the shop can install them. and make custom kits. <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 02-05-2001).]||||reg||1
